SUMMARY:Review LLM model and literature updates
DESCRIPTION:Monthly human review after automatic discovery on the 14th.\n1.
 Open the repository Actions page and check that the workflow
 succeeded.\n2.
 If needed\, run Deploy dashboard to GitHub Pages manually.\n3. Run git
 pull --ff-only locally.\n4. Ask Sol to screen both discovery JSON files
 without automatic promotion.\n5. Read and confirm consequential model or
 literature
 decisions.\n6. Have Sol update the appraisal log\, QMD\, references and
 dashboard rules where warranted\, validate them\, commit and push.\nGuide:
 UPDATE_AND_PUBLISH.qmd
